  "limitations": [
    "Existing controls and TTMAPP already seen; new synthetic seeds are not independent experimental validation.",
    "Random-phase rows are negative for a shared 2D lattice; individual rows are periodic and local chance agreements can occur.",
    "Only four supported negative sites pass windowed ACF for each curvature threshold.",
    "Curvature is an experimental finite-difference diagnostic with retained old peak search, lags, boundary reflection and connectivity.",
